@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix void: <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#> .

<http://w3id.org/bb5kbc/ont/Kulturgruppe> a owl:Class,
        <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource>,
        <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/turtle#Resource> ;
    rdfs:label "Kulturgruppe"@de,
        "Cultural Group"@en ;
    void:inDataset <http://w3id.org/bb5kbc/Brandenburg_5000_BC_Data> ;
    rdfs:comment """Cultural group as a stable Named Node. URI: kultur_{MD5(label)[:8]}.
9 distinct values (SBK, SRK, BKK, FBG, Rössener Kultur, Guhrau,
Mesolithikum, SBK?, SRK?). Uncertain assignments (SBK?, SRK?) get their own nodes.
Perio.do URI (perio.do column, currently empty in CSV) will be added via
bb5kbc:hasExternalIdentifier when available."""@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E4_Period> .

